  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-9697-PPG-Restoration and Conservation of Key Biodiversity Areas and Ecosystems in Anbar Province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to enhance Iraq&#x2019;s natural ecosystem resilience by integrating biodiversity and climate change concerns into environmental land use planning and sustainable land management policies and practices. The project will also apply an integrated approach of policy reforms, strengthening landscape management capacities and sustainable application of energy-water-food nexus to restore oases ecosystem in Anbar Province, Western Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
